,"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":546,"link_death_year":613,"link_td_description":"刘炫，隋经学家。字光伯。河间景城（今河北献县东北）人。","link_td_id":"Q10014201","link_td_number_id":1841967,"people_name":"劉炫","people_name_jianti_auto":"刘炫","people_xingming":"刘炫","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b4318681-db0e-11ef-a94d-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[杨坚本年六十一岁]"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河間","place_name_jianti_auto":"河间","place_note":"河北省河间市","resolved_place_entity_id":582,"start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"b4318682-db0e-11ef-b520-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"9乙丑，詔以天下學校生徒多而不精，唯簡留國子學生七十人，太學、四門及州縣學並廢。殿內將軍河間劉炫上表切諫，不聽。秋，七月，改國子學爲太學。","content_fanyi":"乙丑日，文帝下诏，认为天下学校的学生虽多却不精良，于是只选拔保留国子学生七十人，太学、四门学以及各州、县的学校一律废止。殿内将军、河间人刘炫上表恳切谏诤，文帝没有采纳。秋季，七月，将国子学改为太学。","content_jianti_auto":"9乙丑，诏以天下学校生徒多而不精，唯简留国子学生七十人，太学、四门及州县学并废。殿内将军河间刘炫上表切谏，不听。秋，七月，改国子学为太学。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17385,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b431866e-db0e-11ef-84d2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","resolved_place_entity_id":87,"start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b4318685-db0e-11ef-af68-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"10初，帝受周禪，恐民心未服，故多稱符瑞以耀之，其僞造而獻者，不可勝計。冬，十一月，己丑，有事于南郊，如封禪禮，版文備述前後符瑞以報謝云。","content_fanyi":"起初，文帝接受北周的禅让，担心民心尚未归服，所以多次宣扬符瑞来炫耀自己受命于天，伪造符瑞进献的人多得无法计数。冬季十一月己丑日，在南郊举行祭天典礼，礼仪如同封禅，刻写在版上的祭文详细叙述先后出现的符瑞，以此报谢上天。","content_jianti_auto":"10初，帝受周禅，恐民心未服，故多称符瑞以耀之，其伪造而献者，不可胜计。冬，十一月，己丑，有事于南郊，如封禅礼，版文备述前后符瑞以报谢云。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":17386,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b4318683-db0e-11ef-96a9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"蜀","place_name_jianti_auto":"蜀","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"b4318688-db0e-11ef-80ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"獠","place_name_jianti_auto":"獠","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"b4318689-db0e-11ef-ad29-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"獠，盧皓翻。蜀有獠。","note_content_jianti_auto":"獠，卢皓翻。蜀有獠。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4318687-db0e-11ef-aaf3-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"洛陽縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛阳县","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b431868b-db0e-11ef-8c69-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"河南郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"河南郡","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b431868c-db0e-11ef-95ce-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"洛州","place_name_jianti_auto":"洛州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b431868d-db0e-11ef-9dac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"資陽郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"资阳郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b431868e-db0e-11ef-954e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"西魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"西魏","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b431868f-db0e-11ef-aedd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"資州","place_name_jianti_auto":"资州","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"b4318690-db0e-11ef-86b4-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"盤石","place_name_jianti_auto":"盘石","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"b4318691-db0e-11ef-8cd0-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：洛陽縣屬河南郡洛州。資陽郡，西魏置資州，治盤石。少，始照翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：洛阳县属河南郡洛州。资阳郡，西魏置资州，治盘石。少，始照翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b431868a-db0e-11ef-b38f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"宋白","people_name_jianti_auto":"宋白","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"b4318694-db0e-11ef-a0ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"大牢縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"大牢县","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b4318695-db0e-11ef-a680-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榮州","place_name_jianti_auto":"荣州","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"b4318696-db0e-11ef-9e47-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"應靈縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"应灵县","start_index":17,"tongjian_id":"b4318697-db0e-11ef-9454-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"b4318698-db0e-11ef-a429-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"南安縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"南安县","start_index":23,"tongjian_id":"b4318699-db0e-11ef-a75e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":27,"tongjian_id":"b431869a-db0e-11ef-b1e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"大牢鎭","place_name_jianti_auto":"大牢镇","start_index":29,"tongjian_id":"b431869b-db0e-11ef-9330-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"開皇十三年，置大牢縣。宋白曰：榮州應靈縣，本漢南安縣，隋置大牢鎭。九域志：在州西一百五十里。","note_content_jianti_auto":"开皇十三年，置大牢县。宋白曰：荣州应灵县，本汉南安县，隋置大牢镇。九域志：在州西一百五十里。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b4318693-db0e-11ef-a0d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"說，輸芮翻。帥，所類翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"说，输芮翻。帅，所类翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":102,"tongjian_id":"b431869e-db0e-11ef-bfe1-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"遂寧郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"遂宁郡","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b43186a0-db0e-11ef-8cdb-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後周","place_name_jianti_auto":"后周","start_index":7,"tongjian_id":"b43186a1-db0e-11ef-acae-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"遂州","place_name_jianti_auto":"遂州","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b43186a2-db0e-11ef-9352-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"隋志：遂寧郡，後周置遂州。","note_content_jianti_auto":"隋志：遂宁郡，后周置遂州。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":134,"tongjian_id":"b431869f-db0e-11ef-8bee-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"衞尉少卿","official_note":"衞尉少卿是衞尉寺的副长官，负责宫廷禁卫和仪仗事务，属于军事系统。在原文中，衞文昇原任此职，后被任命为资州刺史去镇压山獠叛乱，体现了从中央军事官员调任地方行政军事长官的调动。","official_rank":"从四品","source_snippet":"以衞尉少卿洛陽衞文昇爲資州刺史鎭撫之","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"5b561626-9e51-44e0-911f-f301b1647d3e"},{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"資州刺史","official_note":"資州刺史是隋朝地方行政长官，掌管資州（今四川资阳一带）的民政、军事和司法。在原文中，衞文昇被任命为此职，负责镇抚山獠叛乱，体现了中央对地方动乱的直接干预。","official_rank":"正四品","source_snippet":"以衞尉少卿洛陽衞文昇爲資州刺史鎭撫之","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"c2759b7e-4cec-4535-b84e-9a76ab72412e"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"地方行政","official_name":"刺史","official_note":"刺史是隋朝州级行政长官，总管一州事务。在原文中，衞文昇自称刺史，以宣示权威，安抚山獠，并执行天子诏命，体现了其作为地方最高官员的职责和权威。","official_rank":"正四品","source_snippet":"我是刺史，銜天子詔，安養汝等，勿驚懼也！","start_index":56,"tongjian_id":"2d56989b-b877-441b-80f6-f0242054af69"},{"confidence":0.85,"official_category":"军事指挥","official_name":"遂州總管","official_note":"遂州總管是隋朝地方军事长官，掌管遂州（今四川遂宁一带）的军事防务，可能兼管民政。在原文中，衞文昇因成功镇抚山獠叛乱，被提升为此职，反映了其军事才能得到认可和晋升。","official_rank":"正三品","source_snippet":"壬辰，以文昇爲遂州總管","start_index":124,"tongjian_id":"ba64e129-5156-4bcc-8ac6-5d2b4a8